  "Einmal am Tag. Licht für {0} Schritte. Schriftrollen gelesen: {1} von {2}. Erbstücke: {3} von {4}.": "Once a day. Light for {0} steps. Scrolls read: {1} of {2}. Heirlooms: {3} of {4}.",
